OL,3,GNEWSACritics say mayor's disability
OL,4,Aplan 'lacks ambition'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe mayor of London's first strategy
OL,7,Ffor deaf and disabled Londoners has
OL,8,Fbeen criticised for lacking ambition,
OL,9,Fwith one London Assembly member warning
OL,10,Fit risks "papering over London's
OL,11,Faccessibility failures".
OL,13,FThe action plan includes measures to
OL,14,Fimprove access to housing, transport,
OL,15,Fjobs, benefits and public services for
OL,16,Fthe capital's 1.2 million deaf and
OL,17,Fdisabled residents.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,326,320,200,140,0,100
