OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSACritics say mayor's disability
OL,4,Aplan 'lacks ambition'
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut Hina Bokhari, leader of the London
OL,7,FAssembly Liberal Democrats, said the
OL,8,Fplans lacked "the scale of ambition,
OL,9,Ftransformation and investment needed to
OL,10,Feven make a dent in the barriers".
OL,12,FLord Sadiq Khan said he was committed
OL,13,Fto "redoubling our efforts to improve
OL,14,Fthe lives of deaf and disabled
OL,15,FLondoners".
